@host = http://localhost:8080
@customerId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa
@mouseId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Token
# @name token
POST {{host}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": "dev-client",
  "clientSecret": "dev-secret-change-me"
}

### Criar pedido
POST {{host}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-pedido-1

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "currency": "BRL",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "{{mouseId}}", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Listar pedidos
GET {{host}}/orders?customerId={{customerId}}&status=Placed&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.accessToken}}
